WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.042 --> 00:00:02.625
We can end the curse!

00:00:04.292 --> 00:00:05.125
For Shadyside.

00:00:07.833 --> 00:00:09.083
What the hell?

00:00:09.667 --> 00:00:10.750
You see it now?

00:00:11.375 --> 00:00:12.542
Sarah!

00:00:14.875 --> 00:00:15.917
The devil has come.

00:00:17.083 --> 00:00:19.167
To feast on our misdeeds!

00:00:21.125 --> 00:00:24.125
And his darkness grows
within each of us.

00:00:26.417 --> 00:00:28.500
Sarah Fier,
you know nothing good comes

00:00:28.583 --> 00:00:30.125
from those woods after sundown.

00:00:32.500 --> 00:00:33.583
What was that?

00:00:35.833 --> 00:00:38.167
Witches!

00:00:41.000 --> 00:00:42.000
The truth

00:00:42.792 --> 00:00:44.042
will follow you…

00:00:47.542 --> 00:00:48.750
forever.

00:00:57.500 --> 00:00:58.583
What happens now?

